{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24679","headline":"得潮州杨相公继之书幷诗以此寄之 · 白居易","name":"得潮州杨相公继之书幷诗以此寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗情书意两殷勤，来自天南瘴海滨。\n初覩银钩还啓齿，细吟琼什欲沾巾。\n凤池隔绝三千里，蜗舍沈冥十五春。\n唯有新昌故园月，至今分照两乡人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}